From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:03:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): fit capsule corners and own its full touch surface

Shared with Mihon 0069. Correct side/bottom margin equality using the supplied Pura screenshot as an approximate 1264x1848 fixture, not a new device-specific runtime rule. Use runtime screen corner metadata/resources, with a documented generic fallback, and support asymmetric lower corners. One initial-pass router owns all glass taps and drags, including end padding and cancellation; preserve child accessibility semantics. Strengthen solid selected words and transmitted/reflected glass light; keep the texture and shader behind the labels.
